==Battleground==
*5 [[Pumpkin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 61.67 seconds<sup>1,850f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pumpkin Doge]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Vlad de Sable]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

